OL,3,AFlight recorders recovered from Amazon
OL,4,Acargo plane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plane hit two vehicles - a cleaning
OL,7,Fvan carrying seven people and a Toyota
OL,8,Fwith three passengers.
OL,10,FNTSB chairwoman Jennifer Homendy said
OL,11,Fit was too early to draw conclusions
OL,12,Fabout what caused the crash, with
OL,13,Finvestigators still in the "fact
OL,14,Ffinding stage".
